{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hos-9-1","title":"Hosea 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The distress and captivity of Israel for their sins.</p>\n<p>Rejoice. 10:5; Isa 17:11; 22:12; La 4:21; Eze 21:10; Am 6:6,7,13; 8:10 Jas 4:16; 5:1 as. Eze 16:47,48; 20:32; Am 3:2 gone. 4:12; 5:4,7 thou hast loved. 2:12; Jer 44:17 upon. or, in, etc.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-2","title":"Hosea 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>floor. 2:9,12; Isa 24:7-12; Joe 1:3-7,9-13; Am 4:6-9,5-11; Mic 6:13-16 Hag 1:9; 2:16 winepress. or, winefat.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-3","title":"Hosea 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>shall not. Le 18:28; 20:22; De 4:26; 28:63; Jos 23:15; 1Ki 9:7; Mic 2:10 the Lord's. Le 25:23; Jer 2:7; 16:18 but. 6; 8:13; 11:5; De 28:68; Isa 11:15,16 \"Not into Egypt itself, but into another bondage as bad asthat.\" and. Eze 4:13; Da 1:8; Ac 10:14 in Assyria. 11:11; 2Ki 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-4","title":"Hosea 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>shall not. 3:4; Joe 1:13; 2:14 neither. 8:13; Isa 1:11-15; 57:6; 66:3; Jer 6:20; Am 4:4,5; 5:22; Mal 1:9,10 as. Nu 19:11; De 26:14; Ne 8:9-12; Eze 24:17,22; Mal 2:13 their bread. Ex 40:23; Le 17:11; 21:6,8,17,21; Nu 4:7; 28:2; Am 8:11,12; Joh 6:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-5","title":"Hosea 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>what. Isa 10:3; Jer 5:31 in. 2:11; Joe 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-6","title":"Hosea 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>they. De 28:63,64; 1Sa 13:6; 2Ki 13:7 destruction. Heb. spoil. 7:13 Egypt. 3; 7:16; 8:13; 11:11; Isa 11:11; 27:12; Zec 10:10,11 the pleasant places for their silver, nettles. or, theirsilver shall be desired, the nettle shall, etc. Heb. the desire of. 10:8; Ps 107:34; Pr 24:31; Isa 5:6; 7:23; 32:13; 34:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-7","title":"Hosea 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>days of visitation. Isa 10:3; Jer 10:15; 11:23; 46:21; Eze 7:2-7; 12:22-28; Am 8:2 Mic 7:4; Zep 1:14-18; Lu 21:22; Re 16:19 Israel. Isa 26:11; Eze 25:17; 38:23 the prophet. 8; Jer 6:14; 8:11; 23:16,17; La 2:14; Eze 13:3,10; Mic 2:11; Zep 3:4 Zec 11:15-17 spiritual man. Heb. man of the spirit. mad. 2Ki 9:11; Jer 29:26; Mr 3:21; Ac 26:24,25; 2Co 5:13 the multitude. Eze 14:9,10; 2Th 2:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-8","title":"Hosea 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>watchman. So 3:3; Isa 62:6; Jer 6:17; 31:6; Eze 3:17; 33:7; Mic 7:4; Heb 13:17 with. 1Ki 17:1; 18:1,36-39; 22:28; 2Ki 2:14,21; 3:15-20; 4:1-7,33-37,41 2Ki 4:43; 5:14,27; 6:17,18; 7:2,19; 13:21 but. 5:1; 1Ki 18:19; 22:6,11,22; Jer 6:14; 14:13; La 2:14; 4:13 in the. or, against the. Joh 15:24; Ro 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-9","title":"Hosea 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>deeply. Isa 24:5; 31:6 Gibeah. 10:9; Jud 19:22-30; 20:1-21:25 therefore. 8:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-10","title":"Hosea 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>found. 11:1; Ex 19:4-6; De 32:10; Jer 2:2,3; 31:2 grapes. 2:15; Nu 13:23,24; Isa 28:4; Mic 7:1 but. Nu 25:3-18; De 4:3; Ps 106:28 separated. 4:14; Jud 6:32; 1Ki 16:31; Jer 11:13; Ro 6:21 and their. Nu 15:39; De 32:17; Ps 81:12; Jer 5:31; Eze 20:8; Am 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-11","title":"Hosea 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>their. Ge 41:52; 48:16-20; 49:22; De 33:17; Job 18:5,18,19 from the birth. Ps 58:8; Ec 6:3; Am 1:13 from the womb. 14; De 28:18,57; Lu 23:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-12","title":"Hosea 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>yet. 13,16; De 28:32,41,42; 32:25; Job 27:14; Jer 15:7; 16:3,4; La 2:20 not. Nu 26:65; Jud 4:16 woe. 5,6; 7:13; De 31:17; 1Sa 16:14; 28:15,16; 2Ki 17:18,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-13","title":"Hosea 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>as. Eze 26:1-28:26 shall. 16; 10:14; 13:8,16; 2Ki 15:16; Jer 9:21; Am 7:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-14","title":"Hosea 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>what. 13,16; Mt 24:19; Mr 13:17; Lu 21:23; 23:29; 1Co 7:26 a miscarrying womb. Heb. a womb that casteth the fruit. Job 21:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-15","title":"Hosea 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>is in. 4:15; 12:11; Jos 4:19-24; 5:2-9; 10:43; 1Sa 7:16; Am 4:4; 5:5; Mic 6:5 I hated. Le 26:30; Eze 23:18; Zec 11:8 I will drive. 3,17; 1:6,9; 3:4; 1Ki 9:7-9; 2Ki 17:17-20; Ps 78:60; Jer 3:8; 11:15 Jer 33:24-26; Am 5:27 all. 5:1,2; Isa 1:23; Jer 5:5; Eze 22:27; Mic 3:11; Zep 3:3; Ac 4:5-7,27 Ac 5:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-16","title":"Hosea 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>their root. 11-13; Job 18:16; Isa 5:24; 40:24; Mal 4:1 the beloved fruit. Heb. the desires. Eze 24:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-9-17","title":"Hosea 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>My God. 2Ch 18:13; Ne 5:19; Ps 31:14; Isa 7:13; Mic 7:7; Joh 20:17,28 Php 4:19 because. 7:13; 1Ki 14:15,16; 2Ki 17:14-20; 2Ch 36:16; Ps 81:11-13; Pr 29:1 Isa 48:18; Jer 25:3,4; 26:4-6; 35:15-17; Zec 1:4; 7:11-14; Ac 3:23 and. De 28:64,65; 32:26; Am 8:2; 9:9; Joh 7:35; Jas 1:1</p>"}]}